  "title": "Chicken Corn Soup",
  "description": "Rivels (a crumb-sized egg noodle) and hard-boiled eggs complete this Pennsylvania Dutch recipe for chicken soup with celery and corn fresh off the cob.",
  "authors": [
    "Teresa"
  ],
